WEBVTT

00:12:28.711 --> 00:12:30.458
While I do these calculations,

00:12:30.482 --> 00:12:32.961
you might hear certain words,

00:12:32.985 --> 00:12:35.976
as opposed to numbers,
creep into the calculation.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.398
Let me explain what that is.

00:12:37.422 --> 00:12:39.504
This is a phonetic code,

00:12:39.528 --> 00:12:41.604
a mnemonic device that I use,

00:12:41.628 --> 00:12:44.438
that allows me to convert
numbers into words.

00:12:44.462 --> 00:12:47.604
I store them as words, and later on
retrieve them as numbers.

00:12:47.628 --> 00:12:49.589
I know it sounds complicated; it's not.

00:12:49.613 --> 00:12:52.945
I don't want you to think you're seeing
something out of "Rain Man."

00:12:52.969 --> 00:12:54.016
(Laughter)

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.096
There's definitely
a method to my madness --

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.348
definitely, definitely.

00:12:57.372 --> 00:12:58.373
Sorry.

00:12:58.397 --> 00:13:01.976
(Laughter)